flowchart TD
    A[Webhook Received] --> B{Valid Signature?}
    B -->|No| C[Log & Reject 401]
    B -->|Yes| D{Event Type?}
    D -->|SUCCEEDED| E[Process Dataset]
    D -->|FAILED| F[Log Failure]
    D -->|ABORTED| F
    D -->|TIMED_OUT| G[Schedule Retry]
    
    E --> H{Already Processed?}
    H -->|Yes runId exists| I[Skip — Idempotent]
    H -->|No| J[Download Dataset Items]
    J --> K{Parse Success?}
    K -->|Yes| L[Save to DB + Publish Event]
    K -->|No| M[Log to Dead Letter Queue]
    
    F --> N[Alert via Winston]
    G --> O[Re-trigger Actor with backoff]